  "details": "\"Request Invite\" and \"Send Invite\" share the same tooltip as declining an invite, which doesn't make sense to me. \"Send your reply to the selected user\" doesn't make sense when you're not replying. \n\nYou can reproduce this by:\n\n1. Open quick menu social or main menu social\n\n2. Select a friend\n\n3. Open the \"Send invite\" dialog\n\n4. Hover over the send invite button",
